{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1959037804"}, "name":{"label":"Altoclef99"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-19T10:24:45-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.16.1"}, "id":{"label":"14447636722"}, "title":{"label":"Latest redesign doesn’t work for me"}, "content":{"label":"I bought an annual subscription after trying this and, apart from a few small niggles, I’ve been very happy. However, the latest redesign of the 5-day screen does not work. The description column is now so narrow I can’t see the whole text. Perhaps you can reduce the number of days to 4 with a horizontal scroll for users to look back further if required. I’m going to hunt for an alternative app as the new design is not usable in my opinion.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
