{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1039910663"}, "name":{"label":"EB13734"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-07T11:16:27-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.15.2"}, "id":{"label":"14274998448"}, "title":{"label":"You WILL Achieve your goals"}, "content":{"label":"I love this app for the sole reason you can track your habits, and see them progress over time as it provides a basis which motivates you to get up and achieve your goals every day.\n\nEventually, i paid for premium (which is by no means necessary), to both support the creator and also display the widgets; helping so much more as every day i could see my progress, reminding me to do the actions leading me towards my goals.\n\nI have been able to focus on my goals (for example this is the first time i have ever gone to the gym every day for a week), and has helped me throughout the journey of achieving my goals.\n\nBy far the best habit tracker on this app, as you can go your own pace and set it up yourself fully. Could not recommend more!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
