{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id42638262"}, "name":{"label":"Biblops"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-04T04:44:25-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.14.3"}, "id":{"label":"13473841112"}, "title":{"label":"So, so close to being flawless!"}, "content":{"label":"This app is unbelievably helpful, well-made and pretty. The aesthetics alone make me want to be more disciplined and consistent in my habits. It just blows my mind that there is no iCloud sync. In this day and age I kind of take for granted that all apps sync across my iPhone and iPad and I’m kind of blown away that it doesn’t have this. I probably wouldn’t have subscribed if I had noticed this sooner.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id345414153"}, "name":{"label":"Xlitufohipkyxgjxbdswadd"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-10-30T03:19:56-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.14.2"}, "id":{"label":"13332990475"}, "title":{"label":"Amazing for my ADHD Brain!"}, "content":{"label":"I don’t usually write reviews but I just wanted to share how well this app works for someone like me who picks tasks/hobbies up and then drops them the next week.\n\nThe same could be said for apps, I’ve had a lot of habit and tracker apps that I go all in on and then once again I drop them. But this one has truly been awesome and I can’t wait to log my colourful square each day.\n\nMaybe that’s it, maybe it’s because it’s just so simple and it LOOKS good too - I think the simplicity works and it looks awesome in dark mode. I’m tracking my calorie defecit, medication and exercise.\n\nSo yes, just a big thank you to me and I’m also going to upgrade to lifetime because even the price is fab!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
