{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1362536894"}, "name":{"label":"_Daaaan"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-11-08T02:29:05-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.9.5"}, "id":{"label":"11925812289"}, "title":{"label":"Exactly What I Needed"}, "content":{"label":"Great UI and intuitive to use. Love the widget design. Did come across a bug in the previous version, but was greeted by excellent customer support when I reported it, rapid response and subsequent fix was delivered. Could Not recommend this app anymore.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1106118563"}, "name":{"label":"🐝🥗🥰"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-30T13:31:17-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.9.4"}, "id":{"label":"11893331005"}, "title":{"label":"The best tracker out there"}, "content":{"label":"I absolutely had to leave a review for this app as it is by far my favourite app on my phone. I have spent ages looking for a habit tracker that I enjoy using and none have stuck aside from this one. The widgets are excellent aswell and the simple yet clear and effective design of this app makes it perfect. I use it for tracking everything from accomplishments to migraines and it has been very helpful in many ways. It is a well designed app which is fantastic to use. My only want would be to have the ability to add a note (as an optional setting) on a tracker for something that, once completed, could benefit from having a description that is viewable for each day when looking back through the calendar. And to have the option to input data, example weight, each day rather than a binary complete or incomplete. \nOverall this is the best habit tracker I’ve found and I’d recommend it to everyone.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
