{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id42688174"}, "name":{"label":"MK7LFC"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-09-24T19:20:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.9.1"}, "id":{"label":"11761381725"}, "title":{"label":"Greatest Habit Tracker"}, "content":{"label":"Simple design giving you as much personalisation as you need (or not) for each habit you want to track. Beautiful in the way it’s presented. Lets you see at a glance how you’re doing and which habits need more attention. Widgets are good too as a constant reminder to stop procrastinating and get on with it to check it off for the day. Finally, the developer is very responsive to any feedback. I can’t fault it. Will definitely keep using to stay on top of all the stuff that I’m trying to improve on - one habit at a time, one day at a time.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1362849069"}, "name":{"label":"Milo 0"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-09-24T11:20:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.9.1"}, "id":{"label":"11760200873"}, "title":{"label":"Brilliant habit tracker"}, "content":{"label":"I love this app so far as its straightforward and simple enough to use without distracting features. Seeing the visual representation of my habit information in a calendar format as a widget is more motivating to me than any other method of habit tracking Ive tried previously. After contacting the developer to suggest new features, he was very prompt and polite with his reply and took in my feedback! :D", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id658072313"}, "name":{"label":"camscottie"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-09-23T14:32:49-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.9.1"}, "id":{"label":"11757164493"}, "title":{"label":"Nice clean interface to track habits"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve tried other apps for tracking habits, but I always found it hard to come back to the apps, mainly because they tried to include too much functionality e.g. goal tracking, mood tracking, etc\n\nThis app gives me the visuals that I need to keep myself accountable of habits, and the interface is nice and simple so it makes it easy to use. Definitely worth the price for me.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id319073818"}, "name":{"label":"The real George Caplan"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-09-23T00:12:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.9.1"}, "id":{"label":"11754886285"}, "title":{"label":"EXACTLY what I was looking for!"}, "content":{"label":"All I needed was some boxes to tick that look good and therefore is a pleasure to use. \nI’ve got a number of habits that I’m working on and seeing the patterns build is very satisfying and encouraging. Perfect!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
