{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id601940876"}, "name":{"label":"ifhsfardi"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-08-25T02:22:32-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.8.4"}, "id":{"label":"11650437167"}, "title":{"label":"Trusts you to own your goals"}, "content":{"label":"The simplicity is great I really hope the app doesn’t add a bunch of bells and whistles down the line – I much prefer being trusted to use the app my way. Other apps in this genre try to motivate you with streaks or journaling or motivation but I find those features distracting and counterproductive.\n\nThe export option is also a deal-breaker for me so great to see that fully supported here.\n\nMy one minor complaint is that organisation can be a bit rough once you have very many habits. It might be nice to be able to put habits in folders or separate pages.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1052525929"}, "name":{"label":"maxisq"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-08-12T16:04:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.8.3"}, "id":{"label":"11602928681"}, "title":{"label":"Amazing free app"}, "content":{"label":"I love how beautiful and simple this habit tracking app is, I’m currently tracking 4 weekly habits and I’m able to do so on the free version! I love an app that provides good value for free, whilst offering nice-to-have features at a reasonable extra price. Great app!!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id558452423"}, "name":{"label":"lividiv"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-08-09T02:23:24-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.8.3"}, "id":{"label":"11589483991"}, "title":{"label":"Clear Concise Habit Tracking"}, "content":{"label":"This is exactly what I was looking for in a habit tracking app. The majority of other apps are too busy, I wanted something streamlined that could show me the days I’d achieved my habits at a glance - this does exactly that and it looks awesome. I also love that you can back-fill habits you’ve completed before getting the app. My only criticism is that it took me a few minutes to figure out the structure of the squares for habits completed - it was irritating me at first that there seemed to be no order. But I quickly realised they resemble days of the year, divided into 52 rows for weeks, Monday-Sunday from top to bottom. Some initial guidance on setup would be fab (apologies if this is already in place and I missed it!). Otherwise, easily the best habit tracking app for anyone who loves things simple, streamlined, and visually pleasing.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
